  "description": "A desperate kidnapper, a billionaire heiress, and a vacation that goes hilariously off-script. When driver-in-disguise Hyeon-ho abducts K-Group heiress Ju-yeon, he expects terror, tears, and a massive ransom. Instead, he gets a shameless seduction from a woman who thinks his dangerous edge is incredibly hot. Mistaking her intense lust for psychological dependency, Hyeon-ho gives into a night of absolute passion. Too bad for him, his guilt wakes up before she does. The second he tries to surrender to the police, Ju-yeon reveals her true colors. He thought he took her captive, but she’s the one who’s never letting him go.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
